WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.283
Welcome to the program.

00:00:03.160 --> 00:00:04.930
Just wore a t-shirt today

00:00:04.930 --> 00:00:07.181
and then seconds before going on thought,

00:00:07.181 --> 00:00:08.930
that's not enough.

00:00:08.930 --> 00:00:10.460
Went to my car,

00:00:10.460 --> 00:00:14.420
found this jacket I've
had forever in the trunk.

00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:16.520
That's why I'm dressed

00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:20.400
like a man having a
horrible midlife crisis,

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:22.600
old jacket found in the car.

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:24.380
Anyway, that's what you get
when you're making a show

00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:26.910
in an abandoned theater during a pandemic.

00:00:26.910 --> 00:00:27.743
All right.

00:00:27.743 --> 00:00:29.740
Great show tonight, Mike Birbiglia,

00:00:29.740 --> 00:00:32.510
very funny gentlemen
will be on the program.

00:00:32.510 --> 00:00:34.232
Speaking of funny gentlemen,

00:00:34.232 --> 00:00:36.700
(laughing)

00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:38.890
I never do transitions, Andy Richter.

00:00:38.890 --> 00:00:39.723
Hi!

00:00:39.723 --> 00:00:41.280
So you hear that, that was nice.

00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:42.113
I did, it was,

00:00:42.113 --> 00:00:44.490
I, I thought you were gonna talk about me.

00:00:44.490 --> 00:00:45.710
When you heard funny gentlemen?

00:00:45.710 --> 00:00:47.443
Yeah, yeah, because I mean, I'm,

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:51.560
I mean, I'm, I'm here basically.

00:00:51.560 --> 00:00:52.870
And also you're the only one here.

00:00:52.870 --> 00:00:53.703
[Andy] I exist.

00:00:53.703 --> 00:00:54.536
Yeah.

00:00:54.536 --> 00:00:56.880
I like too that your midlife crisis jacket

00:00:56.880 --> 00:00:58.370
is an old jacket.

00:00:58.370 --> 00:00:59.203
[Conan] I know.

00:00:59.203 --> 00:01:00.480
Meaning, you've already gone through it.

00:01:00.480 --> 00:01:01.740
Yeah, I'm,

00:01:01.740 --> 00:01:04.753
that's just a, sort of a
hint at how old I really am.

00:01:04.753 --> 00:01:05.586
(laughing)

00:01:05.586 --> 00:01:07.070
Is that--
You've come to terms.

00:01:07.070 --> 00:01:09.770
Yeah, I found my midlife crisis jacket

00:01:09.770 --> 00:01:11.810
in the car from like eight years ago.

00:01:11.810 --> 00:01:12.643
Yeah, yeah.

00:01:12.643 --> 00:01:13.476
It's been driving around.

00:01:13.476 --> 00:01:14.309
Do you ever do that?

00:01:14.309 --> 00:01:15.476
Do you ever keep a jacket

00:01:15.476 --> 00:01:18.200
in your car in case

00:01:18.200 --> 00:01:19.390
you're stuck somewhere

00:01:19.390 --> 00:01:20.880
and it got cold suddenly,
[Andy] Yes.

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:21.830
you don't have a jacket.

00:01:21.830 --> 00:01:23.280
I used to do that all the time,

00:01:23.280 --> 00:01:24.750
but now I have a big dog

00:01:24.750 --> 00:01:26.730
so there's no room for
anything but dog in my car.

00:01:26.730 --> 00:01:27.930
[Conan] Yeah.
Yeah.

00:01:27.930 --> 00:01:29.180
You could wear the dog.

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:32.320
I keep talking to her about it,

00:01:32.320 --> 00:01:34.670
[Conan] Yeah.
but she's just not amenable.

